    },
    {
      "ref": "A7",
      "row": 6,
      "col": 0,
      "bg": "#ffd23f",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "I only know 25 letters of the alphabet. I don't know y."
    },
    {
      "ref": "B7",
      "row": 6,
      "col": 1,
      "bg": "#3bceac",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "If you replace every part of a ship, is it still the same ship?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "C7",
      "row": 6,
      "col": 2,
      "bg": "#ee4266",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Octopuses have three hearts."
    },
    {
      "ref": "D7",
      "row": 6,
      "col": 3,
      "bg": "#540d6e",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "I'm reading a book about anti-gravity. It's impossible to put down."
    },
    {
      "ref": "E7",
      "row": 6,
      "col": 4,
      "bg": "#0ead69",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Do you and I see the same red?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "F7",
      "row": 6,
      "col": 5,
      "bg": "#f4a261",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Botanically, bananas are berries and strawberries aren't."
    },
    {
      "ref": "A8",
      "row": 7,
      "col": 0,
      "bg": "#2a9d8f",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Why don't eggs tell jokes? They'd crack each other up."
    },
    {
      "ref": "B8",
      "row": 7,
      "col": 1,
      "bg": "#e9c46a",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Is a hole something or nothing?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "C8",
      "row": 7,
      "col": 2,
      "bg": "#264653",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "A day on Venus is longer than a year on Venus."
    },
    {
      "ref": "D8",
      "row": 7,
      "col": 3,
      "bg": "#f28482",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "I used to hate facial hair, but then it grew on me."
    },
    {
      "ref": "E8",
      "row": 7,
      "col": 4,
      "bg": "#84a59d",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "If nobody remembers it, did it really happen?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "F8",
      "row": 7,
      "col": 5,
      "bg": "#f6bd60",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Wombats produce cube-shaped poop."
    },
    {
      "ref": "A9",
      "row": 8,
      "col": 0,
      "bg": "#9b5de5",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "What do you call a fake noodle? An impasta."
    },
    {
      "ref": "B9",
      "row": 8,
      "col": 1,
      "bg": "#00bbf9",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Can you step into the same river twice?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "C9",
      "row": 8,
      "col": 2,
      "bg": "#f15bb5",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Sharks have been around longer than trees."
    },
    {
      "ref": "D9",
      "row": 8,
      "col": 3,
      "bg": "#fee440",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "I'd tell you a construction joke, but I'm still working on it."
    },
    {
      "ref": "E9",
      "row": 8,
      "col": 4,
      "bg": "#1d3557",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Are you the same person you were ten years ago?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "F9",
      "row": 8,
      "col": 5,
      "bg": "#e76f51",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "There are more trees on Earth than stars in the Milky Way."
    },
    {
      "ref": "A10",
      "row": 9,
      "col": 0,
      "bg": "#8ecae6",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Why did the scarecrow win an award? He was outstanding in his field."
    },
    {
      "ref": "B10",
      "row": 9,
      "col": 1,
      "bg": "#6a994e",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Is it possible to think about nothing?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "C10",
      "row": 9,
      "col": 2,
      "bg": "#ffd23f",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Butterflies taste with their feet."
    },
    {
      "ref": "D10",
      "row": 9,
      "col": 3,
      "bg": "#3bceac",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "What do you call cheese that isn't yours? Nacho cheese."
    },
    {
      "ref": "E10",
      "row": 9,
      "col": 4,
      "bg": "#ee4266",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Would you want to know the date of your death?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "F10",
      "row": 9,
      "col": 5,
      "bg": "#540d6e",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "A teaspoon of neutron star would weigh about a billion tonnes."
    },
    {
      "ref": "A11",
      "row": 10,
      "col": 0,
      "bg": "#0ead69",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Why can't a bicycle stand on its own? It's two tired."
    },
    {
      "ref": "B11",
      "row": 10,
      "col": 1,
      "bg": "#f4a261",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "If a copy of you had all your memories, would it be you?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "C11",
      "row": 10,
      "col": 2,
      "bg": "#2a9d8f",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Sunlight takes about 8 minutes to reach Earth."
    },
    {
      "ref": "D11",
      "row": 10,
      "col": 3,
      "bg": "#e9c46a",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "What do you call a bear with no teeth? A gummy bear."
    },
    {
      "ref": "E11",
      "row": 10,
      "col": 4,
      "bg": "#264653",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Is a lie okay if no one ever finds out?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "F11",
      "row": 10,
      "col": 5,
      "bg": "#f28482",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Tardigrades have survived exposure to open space."
    },
    {
      "ref": "A12",
      "row": 11,
      "col": 0,
      "bg": "#84a59d",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "I told my wife she was drawing her eyebrows too high. She looked surprised."
    },
    {
      "ref": "B12",
      "row": 11,
      "col": 1,
      "bg": "#f6bd60",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Do we choose our tastes, or do they choose us?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "C12",
      "row": 11,
      "col": 2,
      "bg": "#9b5de5",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Babies have more bones than adults."
    },
    {
      "ref": "D12",
      "row": 11,
      "col": 3,
      "bg": "#00bbf9",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Why was the math book sad? It had too many problems."
    },
    {
      "ref": "E12",
      "row": 11,
      "col": 4,
      "bg": "#f15bb5",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "What makes a place feel like home?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "F12",
      "row": 11,
      "col": 5,
      "bg": "#fee440",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Lightning is about five times hotter than the surface of the Sun."
    },
    {
      "ref": "A13",
      "row": 12,
      "col": 0,
      "bg": "#1d3557",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "How does a penguin build its house? Igloos it together."
    },
    {
      "ref": "B13",
      "row": 12,
      "col": 1,
      "bg": "#e76f51",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Is time passing, or are we?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "C13",
      "row": 12,
      "col": 2,
      "bg": "#8ecae6",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Venus spins in the opposite direction to most planets."
    },
    {
      "ref": "D13",
      "row": 12,
      "col": 3,
      "bg": "#6a994e",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "I don't trust stairs. They're always up to something."
    },
    {
      "ref": "E13",
      "row": 12,
      "col": 4,
      "bg": "#ffd23f",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Can something be beautiful if no one ever sees it?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "F13",
      "row": 12,
      "col": 5,
      "bg": "#3bceac",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Your stomach lining renews itself every few days."
    },
    {
      "ref": "A14",
      "row": 13,
      "col": 0,
      "bg": "#ee4266",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "I'm on a seafood diet. I see food and I eat it."
    },
    {
      "ref": "B14",
      "row": 13,
      "col": 1,
      "bg": "#540d6e",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "What would you do if you knew you couldn't fail?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "C14",
      "row": 13,
      "col": 2,
      "bg": "#0ead69",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "At its triple point, water can boil and freeze at the same time."
    },
    {
      "ref": "D14",
      "row": 13,
      "col": 3,
      "bg": "#f4a261",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Did you get a haircut? No, I got them all cut."
    },
    {
      "ref": "E14",
      "row": 13,
      "col": 4,
      "bg": "#2a9d8f",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Does a spreadsheet dream of its cells?"
    },
    {
      "ref": "F14",
      "row": 13,
      "col": 5,
      "bg": "#e9c46a",
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Properly sealed honey can stay edible for centuries."
    }
  ],
